{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>Her Name</strong>, a 2D platformer and puzzle game where every movement, every silence, and every light tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by a mysterious sphere sliding along its rails, move in synergy with it to uncover the fears, doubts, and dreams of a character searching for meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game never speaks.<br>It shows.<br>It listens.<br>And it invites you to do the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no dialogue, <strong>Her Name</strong> asks you to observe the world, read between gestures, and interpret symbols. Explore six thematic chapters, navigate 39 puzzle levels, solve over a hundred challenges, and discover 31 scripted narrative stages that slowly assemble a fragile, complex, and essential love story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 24 hidden objects, unravel the mysteries of reality and dreams, and accompany the character to the heart of what haunts him\u2026 and what keeps him standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore his dreams. Face his fears. And finally discover\u2026 her name.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2143760/d4c92abc8173beab6df243faf5bc1f7b121222c8.jpg"},{"name":"Routine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2143760/8b2f90cb0be1e9c98b272a61a2b89f4bde237478.jpg"},{"name":"First sight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2143760/bc59be70783b873f89983388e6488d0fc63a4e9e.jpg"},{"name":"Greyness on the ivory tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2143760/18853930dfb14ab9cd22ab4375be53fef265aeca.jp