liding along its rails, move in synergy with it to uncover the fears, doubts, and dreams of a character searching for meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game never speaks.<br>It shows.<br>It listens.<br>And it invites you to do the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no dialogue, <strong>Her Name</strong> asks you to observe the world, read between gestures, and interpret symbols. Explore six thematic chapters, navigate 39 puzzle levels, solve over a hundred challenges, and discover 31 scripted narrative stages that slowly assemble a fragile, complex, and essential love story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 24 hidden objects, unravel the mysteries of reality and dreams, and accompany the character to the heart of what haunts him\u2026 and what keeps him standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore his dreams. Face his fears. And finally discover\u2026 her name.</strong></p>","developers":["Flying Butter"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143760/02dd30cfc3d27f3370bded165469995534fc3932/header.jpg?t=1763969169","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Flying Butter. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2143760/211981744/925010d3cccf102e43ccb8291d19ff43d8fbec2e/1763137413/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763138904","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2143760/211981744/925010d3cccf102e43ccb8291d19ff43d8fbec2e/1763137413/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763138904","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2143760/211981744/925010d3cccf102e43ccb8291d19ff43d8fbec2e/1763137413/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763138904","id":256909968,"